  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Sealed in white jade, Lian Ke Xin tells Gu Yue Fang Xiang that if he can refine the rank four earth refinement Gu and refine this white jade from the outside, it will save her a lot of effort. She gives him pointers and the Gu recipe, and instructs him to find suitable Gu materials nearby. After spending three days, he refines the rank four earth refinement Gu on his first try and feels lucky, because as a mixed blood he does not usually refine rank four Gu worms so easily. Twelfth Hair, hiding nearby, knows the success came from his secret help. After obtaining the Gu, Gu Yue Fang Xiang goes into the deep pool and starts to refine the white jade.",
